71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FHAtFywWIlYQ7kNvwGKWqML&_nc_oc=Adrdmvc5fTn8ul0cXfNiXoxtEQ-3vvfprEhSiobros8j1jl2hxBmmkuYT9m3MRqyZv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-HVR2jf3Cx3AN9wbnDAMOoZGK2SbJyIzJgbm-2zQoEqw&oe=6A2EA839"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tlS0zMW9DzIQ7kNvwEbhuVo&_nc_oc=Adp7sZrk2-XvFiepzg5GtpZE_vekFSH31rqY0TzR_t05Edlty5cW7AqA3K3EW3-Aczk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Mrvi0ubyluxmn3PyokXrGUTx1TC7Nbs5gvCBBZpzqQA&oe=6A2EBB13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uwta1xZv-J0Q7kNvwF2_rCT&_nc_oc=AdrxhJvEF6AJ4-Bs5-5dJXy7FzEaFdsPUPcI9cErOL9Me8DRr6Wy69ONiWWPBHcovpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-CH2rGVk7dtx9q2BfzBjoNS42LgbvR2YFMoC0mJOAwaQ&oe=6A2EB95A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: